msgstr "Picks one or more logs ONLY from the Library (no manual import here), then a viewer: Simple (live tail + generic stats), Classic (reading + follow), lnav (multi-log merge)."

#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/logs.py:173
