msgstr "Shows the full difference between the default values and the configuration built by the wizard, then actually writes the configuration file."

#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/wizard.py:173
#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/screens/wizard_summary_screen.py:40
